e\: Hold inne OK på Innstillinger\, og velg Modulkort.";card_prompt_hint,81,V4003b1073,81003b10f0,;"Je kunt dit later wijzigen\: houd OK ingedrukt op Instellingen en kies Modulekaarten.";card_prompt_hint,82,V400250a7c,8900250b01,;"Możesz to później zmienić\: przytrzymaj OK na przycisku Ustawienia i wybierz Karty aplikacji.";card_prompt_hint,83,V4002609ac,6500260a0d,;"Você pode mudar isso depois\: segure OK em Configurações.";card_prompt_hint,84,V400260a9b,8d00260b24,;"Позже это можно изменить\: удерживайте OK на кнопке «Настройки» и выберите «Карточки приложений».";card_prompt_hint,86,V4002509de,8f00250a69,;"Bunu daha sonra değiştirebilirsiniz\: Ayarlar üzerinde OK tuşunu basılı tutup Modül kartları seçin.";card_prompt_hint,87,V4003b1059,94003b10e9,;"Buni keyin oʻzgartirishingiz mumkin\: Sozlamalar ustida OK ni bosib turing va Modul kartalarini tanlang.";card_prompt_hint,94,V400340d9b,6a00340e01,;"Bạn có thể đổi sau\: giữ OK trên Cài đặt\, rồi chọn Thẻ mô-đun.";card_prompt_hint,89,V400310a2d,4900310a72,;"之後可以再改：在「設定」上長按確認鍵，再選「模組卡片」。";screensaver_app,67,V400b52f1a,4200b52f58,;"Screen saver app\: %1$s";screensaver_app,68,V4006a1ca8,43006a1ce7,;"تطبيق شاشة التوقف\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,67,V40024085a,3b00240891,;"Wallpaper\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,74,V400411105,3700411138,;"Fondo\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,77,V40020075a,3b00200791,;"Wallpaper\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,78,V4001c06d2,38001c0706,;"Sfondo\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,79,V4005c17d8,35005c1809,;"טפט\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,80,V4002107ba,40002107f6,;"Bakgrunnsbilde\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,81,V4002107b0,3d002107e9,;"Achtergrond\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,83,V4005014af,41005014ec,;"Papel de parede\: %1$s";wallpaper_state,87,V4002107b1,3b002107e8,;"Fon rasmi\: %1$s";prayer_test_azan_stop,67,V4009926a8,45009926e9,;"Stop Azan preview ⏹";prayer_dhuhr,67,V4007e1f6f,2e007e1f99,;"Dhuhr";azan_makkah,67,V400a128e5,3700a12918,;"Azan 1 (Makkah)";reset_adjustments,67,V4008d2336,44008d2376,;"Reset adjustments to 0";azan_alaqsa,67,V400a32957,3800a3298b,;"Azan 3 (Al-Aqsa)";advanced_effects_warning,67,V4002b0a0e,b4002b0abe,;"Adds a lifted tile\, icon zoom and smooth colour transitions. May increase memory use\; the actual difference depends on your TV.";advanced_effects_warning,68,V400390ec1,9100390f4e,;"ترفع البطاقات وتكبّر الأيقونات وتنعّم انتقالات الألوان. قد تزيد استهلاك الذاكرة حسب التلفاز.";advanced_effects_warning,69,V40025090e,9e002509a8,;"Podiže pločice\, uvećava ikone i ublažava prelaze boja. Može povećati potrošnju memorije\, zavisno od TV-a.";advanced_effects_warning,70,V4002307ff,c1002308bc,;"এতে টাইল একটু উপরে উঠে আসে\, আইকন জুম হয় এবং কালার স্মুথভাবে বদলায়। মেমরি বেশি লাগতে পারে\; কতটা পার্থক্য হবে তা আপনার টিভির উপর নির্ভর করে।";advanced_effects_warning,71,V4001d0611,ae001d06bb,;"Eleva les targetes\, amplia les icones i suavitza els canvis de color. Pot augmentar l’ús de memòria\; depèn del televisor.";advanced_effects_warning,72,V4001f075e,b7001f0811,;"Přidá zvednutou dlaždici\, zvětšení ikon a plynulé přechody barev. Může zvýšit spotřebu paměti\, skutečný rozdíl záleží na televizi.";advanced_effects_warning,73,V400210749,b4002107f9,;"Hebt Kacheln an\, vergrößert Symbole und glättet Farbübergänge. Kann den Speicherverbrauch erhöhen\; die Wirkung hängt vom TV ab.";advanced_effects_warning,74,V4001e063f,b3001e06ee,;"Eleva las tarjetas\, amplía los iconos y suaviza los cambios de color. Puede aumentar el uso de memoria\; depende del televisor.";advanced_effects_warning,75,V4002007b7,b80020086b,;"Lisää ruudun noston\, kuvakkeen zoomauksen ja pehmeät värisiirtymät. Voi lisätä muistinkäyttöä\; todellinen ero riippuu televisiosta.";advanced_effects_warning,76,V400380e8c,bb00380f43,;"Soulève les tuiles\, agrandit les icônes et adoucit les transitions de couleur. Peut augmenter la mémoire utilisée selon le téléviseur.";advanced_effects_warning,77,V400270903,be002709bd,;"Menambah tile terangkat\, zoom ikon\, dan transisi warna yang halus. Dapat menambah penggunaan memori\; perbedaan aktual tergantung TV Anda.";advanced_effects_warning,78,V40023088b,c30023094a,;"Aggiunge riquadro sollevato\, zoom dell'icona e transizioni di colore fluide. Può aumentare l'uso di memoria\; la differenza dipende dalla TV.";advanced_effects_warning,79,V400220792,9e0022082c,;"מוסיף אריח מוגבה\, הגדלת סמלים ומעברי צבע חלקים. עשוי להגדיל את צריכת הזיכרון\; ההבדל בפועל תלוי בטלוויזיה.";advanced_effects_warning,80,V400280984,a800280a28,;"Legger til løftede appfliser\, ikonzoom og myke fargeoverganger. Kan øke minnebruken. Forskjellen avhenger av TV-en.";advanced_effects_warning,81,V40028097d,c300280a3c,;"Voegt een zwevende tegel\, icoonzoom en vloeiende kleurovergangen toe. Kan meer geheugen gebruiken\; het werkelijke verschil hangt af van je tv.";advanced_effects_warning,82,V400380f68,a90038100d,;"Unosi kafelki\, powiększa ikony i wygładza przejścia kolorów. Może zwiększyć zużycie pamięci\, zależnie od telewizora.";advanced_effects_warning,83,V400571674,b600571726,;"Adiciona elevação do bloco\, zoom no ícone e transições de cor suaves. Pode usar mais memória\; a diferença real depende da sua TV.";advanced_effects_warning,84,V400390f9f,b900391054,;"Приподнимает плитки\, увеличивает значки и сглаживает переходы цвета. Может увеличить расход памяти\; результат зависит от телевизора.";advanced_effects_warning,85,V4001f0618,91001f06a5,;"ยกไทล์ ขยายไอคอน และเปลี่ยนสีพื้นหลังอย่างนุ่มนวล อาจใช้หน่วยความจำเพิ่มขึ้น ขึ้นอยู่กับทีวี";advanced_effects_warning,86,V400380ec1,b100380f6e,;"Kutucukları yükseltir\, simgeleri büyütür ve renk geçişlerini yumuşatır. Bellek kullanımını artırabilir\; etki TV’ye bağlıdır.";advanced_effects_warning,87,V400280977,c600280a39,;"Plitkani koʻtarish\, belgini kattalashtirish va ranglarning silliq oʻtishini qoʻshadi. Xotira sarfi oshishi mumkin\; farq televizoringizga bogʻliq.";advanced_effects_warning,94,V40021075c,a900210801,;"Thêm hiệu ứng ô nổi lên\, phóng to biểu tượng và chuyển màu mượt. Có thể tốn thêm bộ nhớ\; mức chênh lệch tùy từng TV.";advanced_effects_warning,88,V4000d0298,5d000d02f1,;"增加卡片上浮、图标缩放和背景颜色平滑过渡；可能增加内存占用，实际变化取决于电视。";advanced_effects_warning,89,V400220666,5d002206bf,;"加上圖塊浮起、圖示放大與背景顏色漸變。可能會多用一些記憶體，實際差異視電視而定。";prayer_location,67,V4008420a1,3a008420d7,;"Location\: %1$s";hijri_adjustment_hint,67,V4008b228b,65008b22ec,;"Adjust Hijri calendar by \+/- days for moon sighting";permission_overlay_title,67,V400ae2c9a,4c00ae2ce2,;"Display Over Other Apps";permission_overlay_title,68,V400631a37,5000631a83,;"الظهور فوق التطبيقات الأخرى";home_key_name,67,V400370da9,3500370dda,;"Home button";home_key_name,68,V4001f0746,35001f0777,;"زر الرئيسية";home_key_name,69,V4001e072a,34001e075a,;"Dugme Home";home_key_name,70,V4002f0baa,33002f0bd9,;"হোম বোতাম";home_key_name,72,V400270a57,3700270a8a,;"Tlačítko Domů";home_key_name,74,V4004a133f,36004a1371,;"Botón Inicio";home_key_name,75,V4002c0bb0,36002c0be2,;"Koti-painike";home_key_name,76,V4001e066d,38001e06a1,;"Bouton Accueil";home_key_name,77,V400330cc8,3800330cfc,;"Tombol beranda";home_key_name,78,V4002f0c6e,34002f0c9e,;"Tasto Home";home_key_name,79,V4002a0a52,34002a0a82,;"כפתור הבית";home_key_name,80,V400340d4f,3400340d7f,;"Hjem-knapp";home_key_name,81,V400340d5d,3300340d8c,;"Home-knop";home_key_name,82,V4001e0732,37001e0765,;"Przycisk Home";home_key_name,83,V4001f06bf,34001f06ef,;"Botão Home";home_key_name,84,V4001f0785,38001f07b9,;"Кнопка «Домой»";home_key_name,86,V4001e06bf,38001e06f3,;"Ana ekran tuşu";home_key_name,87,V400340d54,3600340d86,;"Home tugmasi";home_key_name,94,V4002d0adb,32002d0b09,;"Nút Home";home_key_name,89,V4002a083c,2e002a0866,;"主畫面鍵";cant_open,67,V4001403df,3600140411,;"Can't open %1$s";cant_open,68,V4001403ee,340014041e,;"تعذّر فتح %1$s";cant_open,69,V400130390,3f001303cb,;"Nije moguće otvoriti %1$s";cant_open,70,V400130380,39001303b5,;"%1$s খোলা যাচ্ছে না";cant_open,71,V40013039c,3f001303d7,;"No s'ha pogut obrir %1$s";cant_open,72,V400130399,39001303ce,;"Nelze otevřít\: %1$s";cant_open,73,V40013037f,42001303bd,;"%1$s lässt sich nicht öffnen";cant_